000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. KSDSNATX.
000300*    ACCESS IS DYNAMIC: a keyed READ and READ NEXT interleaved on
000400*    one open file, which is the thing DYNAMIC exists for and the
000500*    thing VSAMIO cannot express -- it opens MACRF=(SEQ,DIR) but
000600*    leaves the RPL in SEQ and never switches it.
000700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000900 FILE-CONTROL.
001000     SELECT KSDS-FILE ASSIGN TO KSDSF01
001100         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
001200         ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
001300         RECORD KEY IS KR-KEY
001400         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001500 DATA DIVISION.
001600 FILE SECTION.
001700 FD  KSDS-FILE
001800     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
001900     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002000 01  KSDS-RECORD.
002100     02  KR-KEY                  PIC X(10).
002200     02  FILLER                  PIC X(70).
002300 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002400 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC X(2) VALUE '00'.
002500 01  END-OF-FILE-SWITCH          PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
002600     88  END-OF-FILE                      VALUE 'Y'.
002700 01  MISSING-SWITCH              PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
002800     88  MISSING                          VALUE 'Y'.
002900 01  RECORD-COUNTER              PIC S9(8) VALUE +0.
003000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003100 000-INITIATE.
003200     DISPLAY 'KSDSNATX: DYNAMIC, KEYED READ AND READ NEXT'.
003300     DISPLAY '-------------------------------------------'.
003400     DISPLAY ' '.
003500     OPEN INPUT KSDS-FILE.
003600 010-PROCESS.
003700     MOVE '2522284049' TO KR-KEY.
003800     PERFORM 100-SEEK-THEN-WALK THRU 109-EXIT.
003900     MOVE '0994201010' TO KR-KEY.
004000     PERFORM 100-SEEK-THEN-WALK THRU 109-EXIT.
004100     MOVE '9999999999' TO KR-KEY.
004200     PERFORM 100-SEEK-THEN-WALK THRU 109-EXIT.
004300 020-TERMINATE.
004400     CLOSE KSDS-FILE.
004500     STOP RUN.
004600 100-SEEK-THEN-WALK.
004700     DISPLAY 'READ BY KEY ' KR-KEY.
004800     MOVE 'N' TO MISSING-SWITCH.
004900     READ KSDS-FILE
005000         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO MISSING-SWITCH.
005100     IF MISSING
005200         DISPLAY '   NO SUCH KEY, STATUS ' WS-STATUS
005300         DISPLAY ' '.
005400     IF NOT MISSING
005500         PERFORM 102-WALK THRU 103-EXIT.
005600 109-EXIT.
005700     EXIT.
005800 102-WALK.
005900     DISPLAY '   FOUND: ' KSDS-RECORD.
006000     MOVE +0 TO RECORD-COUNTER.
006100     MOVE 'N' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
006200     PERFORM 104-NEXT THRU 105-EXIT
006300         UNTIL END-OF-FILE OR RECORD-COUNTER > +2.
006400     DISPLAY ' '.
006500 103-EXIT.
006600     EXIT.
006700 104-NEXT.
006800     READ KSDS-FILE NEXT RECORD
006900         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
007000     IF NOT END-OF-FILE
007100         DISPLAY '    NEXT: ' KSDS-RECORD.
007200     ADD +1 TO RECORD-COUNTER.
007300 105-EXIT.
007400     EXIT.
